  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>(A)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Sn</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;is a good reducing agent which gets oxidise into&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Sn</mi><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math></p><p>(B)&nbsp;Amphoteric nature.</p><p>(C)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>PbCl</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>Cl</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>&#10230;</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><msub><mi>PbCl</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math></p><p>(D)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mrow><msub><mi>Pb</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>PbO</mi><mtext>&#8196;</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>&#8196;</mtext><msub><mi>PbO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>)</mo></mrow></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><mrow><mn>4</mn><msub><mi>HNO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>Conc</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>)</mo></mrow></munder><mo>&#8594;</mo><msub><mi>PbO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8595;</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>Pb</mi><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>NO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math></p>"
